//===== rAthena Script =======================================
//= Juno Monster Society
//===== Description: =========================================
//= [Walkthrough Conversion]
//= NPCs that give hunting quests in exchange for experience.
//===== Changelog: ===========================================
//= 1.0 First version. [Capuche]
